│                                      ││                                                          │
└──────────────────────────────────────┘│  Pull Requests                                           │
┌─ [4] Workflows ──────────────────────┐│                                                          │
│ Time  Result  Job Name  Run Name  Run││  You can interact with a PR by viewing its details,      │
│                                   ▎  ││  viewing the PR diff, and participating in any active    │
│                                      ││  conversations happening on the PR. You can also         │
│                                      ││  create a new PR for the currently selected repo.        │
│                                      ││                                                          │
